  "selection_reason": [
    "GPT-OSS was the strongest raw generator on the frozen Phase 8 comparison benchmark.",
    "K7 with FK expansion disabled achieved 95% strict accuracy, 100% semantic accuracy, and 100% execution success.",
    "The combined K5 plus FK-off candidate did not preserve the individual ablation gains.",
    "Value grounding and RAG examples were retained because disabling either reduced accuracy.",
    "Self-correction was retained because disabling it reduced execution reliability.",
    "Semantic review was retained because disabling it produced a substantial semantic accuracy decrease.",
    "Base Qwen FULL and Qwen LoRA FULL are hybrid pipelines that use GPT-OSS correction and semantic review and therefore are not treated as pure local-model results."
